        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>First Impressions 9 Inch Modern Rectangular Shower Door Pulls</b>\r\n<p>\r\nThese new contemporary rectangular shower door pulls from First Impressions International, the leader in innovative pull designs. \r\nThey are available in you choice of <b>Polished Chrome</b> or <b>Satin Nickel</b> finish.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nAlso available in larger sizes: <a href=\"/products/aluminum-modern-door-pull-first-impressions-3250\"><b>Aluminum Modern Door Pull</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for First Impressions FII-SD-3250-226 Shower Door Pull\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Pull Total Length: 9\" (226 mm)</li>\r\n<li>Mounting Centers: 6\" Center to Center</li>\r\n<li>Pull Width: 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Thickness: 3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Projection: 1-15/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Material: Non-Rusting Solid Aluminum</li>\r\n<li>Available Finishes: 2</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>Packaged with 2 door pull handles and includes the hardware for back to back mounting on 1/4\" to 1/2\" thick glass shower doors. \r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>*Sold as a Pair (2 Pulls)</b>\r\n</p>",
